(7598881, 1227287, 173844, '<td valign="top">This looks very much an abstract take on a stand of bamboo, and I like it a lot.  That said, I therefore wish (selfishly) that the lower left black triangle weren''t there.</td>', 'This looks very much an abstract take on a stand of bamboo, and I like it a lot.  That said, I therefore wish (selfishly) that the lower left black triangle weren''t there.', '2018-10-17 15:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7598882, 1226876, 173844, '<td valign="top">Way cool.  The subtlety and movement are absorbing.  Are the bright red, white and blues part of the scene or pulled up afterwards?  They both add and subtract, so I can''t decide what I feel about them.  No matter, your vision and image.</td>', 'Way cool.  The subtlety and movement are absorbing.  Are the bright red, white and blues part of the scene or pulled up afterwards?  They both add and subtract, so I can''t decide what I feel about them.  No matter, your vision and image.', '2018-10-17 15:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7598883, 1226816, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely pattern.  I happen to prefer, subjectively of course, the un-sunlit portion of the image, and without the blurred leaves in the lower left.  For the sake of purity --  wink.</td>', 'Lovely pattern.  I happen to prefer, subjectively of course, the un-sunlit portion of the image, and without the blurred leaves in the lower left.  For the sake of purity --  wink.', '2018-10-17 15:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
