(7599015, 1227182, 16912, '<td valign="top">WOW Karen, if I were to be  beaten by a leaf  then it had to be an "elephant ear" plant leaf ;) I think all challenges should be Minimal Editing - I''m sure we''d still have great quality.<br/> <br/>I still remember this quote from Don on one of my images "<i>This photo is krnodilesque</i>" <br/> <br/>(almost) as flattering as receiving a virtul ribbon lol.</td>', 'WOW Karen, if I were to be  beaten by a leaf  then it had to be an "elephant ear" plant leaf ;) I think all challenges should be Minimal Editing - I''m sure we''d still have great quality. I still remember this quote from Don on one of my images "This photo is krnodilesque"  (almost) as flattering as receiving a virtul ribbon lol.', '2018-10-20 11:06:58.000000', NULL, 0),
